From 8ebcb1b02442a6ea8e3c0d048e87ff1fb55440ad Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 04:23:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Port Design mockup's subject-card layout into dashboard,
 gradebook, and grades

Rebuilds the student dashboard around the mockup's per-course subject
cards (teacher + schedule as bulleted divider lines, pill "View Class"
button) backed by real GradedCount/PendingAssignments data instead of
the mockup's fictional quiz/activity split. Adds a client-side
Announcements feed assembled from per-course Material records (type
"announcement") since the dashboard endpoint doesn't expose one.
Adds the mockup's summary stat row to teacher-gradebook.html, computed
from the real gradebook payload. Tightens grades.html and login page
styling to match the same visual language.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HAG55GJ6FJtYXKjD8JHAfC
